text:
[ CW ] Write a creative story using only dialogue . Write an image directly using the script tag. Write a story using multiple paragraphs from source (e.g., a scene with the dialogue "Oh, so what the fuck is up with us. It's been a bunch of shit all my life!!")

) Write stories using just an excerpt. Write a story using only the text tag and then using it in your story. Story elements are placed after each step or in between the first or second paragraph of your script.

When writing a script that is similar to an English text file, remember the syntax, grammar and punctuation requirements

